TITLE Scenario 435: pH=6.0, Metals=Low, None=0mg/L, Clay, Wet
SOLUTION 1  Multi-metal contaminated soil
    temp      25
    pH        6.0
    pe        3
    units     mol/L
    Pb        1.2066e-04  # 25 mg/L
    Cu        3.1471e-04  # 20 mg/L
    Zn        4.5886e-04  # 30 mg/L
    Ca        1.25e-3
    Mg        8.23e-4
    Na        4.35e-3
    Cl        4.23e-3
    C(4)      1.0e-3

    
SURFACE 1  Soil surface sites
    Hfo_wOH   1.5  600  0.09
    -equil 1
    
END
